#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Alpha Team, from its boot into its front end and through it with the
# keyboard and the mouse.
#
# The attract screen waits for anything a person does, and Space is what this
# gives it; the main menu is up by flip 480.
#
# The pointer on screen from there is the title's own, not the machine's.
# DDMouse puts the pointer back in the middle of the window after every frame
# and steers by how far it went since, a 1280th of the window per pixel, so a
# move here says how far the hand moved rather than where it ended up, and the
# title's pointer starts in the bottom left corner. Four moves of the same
# amount walk it onto Single Missions: 4 x 160 px right is half the window
# across, and 4 x 203 px up is 0.634 of it, which is the row the second item
# is on. The click there opens the mission list.
flip 160 key Space down
flip 162 key Space up
flip 600 move 480 37
flip 602 move 480 37
flip 604 move 480 37
flip 606 move 480 37
flip 620 down
flip 622 up
